*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD file for Star Micronics Line Mode Receipt Printers
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "STARLINE.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Star"
*Product: "(Star Line Mode Receipt)"
*ModelName: "Star TSP100 / TSP650 Line Mode"
*ShortNickName: "Star TSP"
*NickName: "Star Micronics Line Mode Receipt Printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Roll Paper: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll80mm
*PageSize Roll80mm/80mm Roll: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll58mm/58mm Roll: "<</PageSize[164 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll80mm
*PageRegion Roll80mm/80mm Roll: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll58mm/58mm Roll: "<</PageSize[164 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Roll80mm
*ImageableArea Roll80mm/80mm Roll: "0 0 227 842"
*ImageableArea Roll58mm/58mm Roll: "0 0 164 842"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll80mm
*PaperDimension Roll80mm/80mm Roll: "227 842"
*PaperDimension Roll58mm/58mm Roll: "164 842"

*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertostar"
*% End of PPD
